00:37:51.899 --> 00:37:53.699
turn into your personal tower of pride.

00:37:53.719 --> 00:37:54.219
Or babble.

00:37:56.299 --> 00:37:58.959
I'm not trying to get closer to God, Dad.

00:37:59.419 --> 00:38:02.339
I'm trying to solve the riddles he's laid out for me.

00:38:03.579 --> 00:38:04.919
Do you ever think there might be a reason

00:38:04.919 --> 00:38:06.219
why we weren't given the answers?

00:38:06.439 --> 00:38:07.559
To challenge us?

00:38:07.739 --> 00:38:09.419
Or maybe to humble us?

00:38:09.879 --> 00:38:12.839
Knowledge comes from finding the answers, yes.

00:38:13.239 --> 00:38:15.619
But understanding what the answers mean

00:38:15.619 --> 00:38:18.159
is what brings wisdom.

00:38:19.199 --> 00:38:20.959
Men who didn't understand the difference

00:38:20.959 --> 00:38:23.379
have been the ruin of some of the world's

00:38:23.379 --> 00:38:23.699
greatest scientists.

00:38:23.699 --> 00:38:24.319
And they've been the ruin of many civilizations.

00:38:27.819 --> 00:38:30.059
Is that why you stopped looking for the stones?

00:38:31.439 --> 00:38:32.519
Because you're afraid?

00:38:35.559 --> 00:38:37.659
No, no, I stopped because I realized

00:38:37.659 --> 00:38:39.359
that even if I find the three stones,

00:38:39.980 --> 00:38:42.480
I'm not going to find what I'm really looking for.

00:38:45.399 --> 00:38:46.319
Neither will you.

00:38:53.879 --> 00:38:56.899
Can I at least come in?

00:39:05.559 --> 00:39:07.460
I guess I don't have to ask why I haven't heard from you

00:39:07.460 --> 00:39:08.599
since we got back from Shanghai.

00:39:15.219 --> 00:39:16.500
I'm sorry I lied to you.

00:39:17.119 --> 00:39:19.599
I don't even know which lie you're apologizing for.

00:39:19.919 --> 00:39:21.439
That you said you were in Metropolis

00:39:21.439 --> 00:39:22.679
when you were really in China,

00:39:22.819 --> 00:39:22.980
or that you've been working in China for a lot longer.

00:39:22.980 --> 00:39:23.059
I don't know.

00:39:23.059 --> 00:39:23.099
I think I don't know.

00:39:23.099 --> 00:39:23.139
Do you know that you've been working in China for a long time?

00:39:23.139 --> 00:39:23.159
Or have you been working in China for a long time?

00:39:23.159 --> 00:39:23.239
Or have you been working in China for a long time?

00:39:23.239 --> 00:39:23.480
Or have you been working in China for a long time?

00:39:23.480 --> 00:39:26.440
working with your mom all along.

00:39:26.440 --> 00:39:27.920
I wasn't honest about going to China

00:39:27.920 --> 00:39:30.820
because I didn't want to put you into danger.

00:39:30.820 --> 00:39:32.340
If you remember a certain torture chair,

00:39:32.340 --> 00:39:33.880
I'd say that's pretty decent foresight.

00:39:37.780 --> 00:39:40.940
You have to believe me.

00:39:40.940 --> 00:39:43.420
Give me one good reason.

00:39:43.420 --> 00:39:44.320
OK.

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:53.320
Are they good enough?

00:39:57.780 --> 00:39:59.700
Jason, how did you?

00:39:59.700 --> 00:40:04.000
I got there right before Lex saw you and Clark knocked out.

00:40:04.000 --> 00:40:07.240
And there it was right in front of me.

00:40:07.240 --> 00:40:08.680
I didn't want Lex or Clark to know about it,

00:40:08.680 --> 00:40:13.000
so I mailed it to myself from China.

00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:14.300
Did you tell your mom?

00:40:14.300 --> 00:40:17.720
I got it for you.

00:40:17.720 --> 00:40:19.320
All I care about is protecting you, OK?

00:40:19.320 --> 00:40:21.260
You're the only one in my life that matters to me.

00:40:28.500 --> 00:40:29.880
Bling twice if you can understand me.

00:40:44.300 --> 00:40:45.200
Funny what you did, huh?

00:41:00.200 --> 00:41:04.640
Well, I do hope you brought us a souvenir.

00:41:04.640 --> 00:41:06.320
I know that going to China is grounds

00:41:06.320 --> 00:41:08.980
for a serious lecture, but I didn't have a choice.

00:41:08.980 --> 00:41:10.900
All right, Clark.

00:41:10.900 --> 00:41:12.940
At least please tell us that the stone is safe in the cave

00:41:12.940 --> 00:41:13.500
with the other one.

00:41:13.500 --> 00:41:16.000
guarding the original map, I got the stone in my hand.

00:41:18.760 --> 00:41:19.760
But I lost it.

00:41:20.360 --> 00:41:21.719
Clark, I don't understand.

00:41:22.019 --> 00:41:23.980
If these stones were intended for you to find,

00:41:24.079 --> 00:41:25.659
why would they be surrounded by kryptonite?

00:41:26.059 --> 00:41:27.920
Yeah, it makes me wonder if they really were meant for me.

00:41:29.280 --> 00:41:30.739
But right now we have another problem.

00:41:32.059 --> 00:41:34.440
Before he died, Dr. Swan sent me one last email.

00:41:34.820 --> 00:41:36.659
He said he'd been searching for the stones for years,

00:41:36.840 --> 00:41:40.039
and even with the vast resources at his disposal, it was futile.

00:41:40.519 --> 00:41:41.679
I was his last hope.

00:41:41.679 --> 00:41:44.559
And that's why I asked Bridget Crosby

00:41:44.559 --> 00:41:46.460
to give me the one stone he did find.

00:41:48.000 --> 00:41:48.899
Which stone?

00:41:49.339 --> 00:41:50.139
That's the thing.

00:41:50.859 --> 00:41:52.799
I called her numbers. They were all disconnected.

00:41:53.339 --> 00:41:54.559
No one even claims to have known her.

00:41:55.319 --> 00:41:56.419
It's like she never existed.

00:42:11.679 --> 00:42:13.919
You can explain everything, Collar.

00:42:19.739 --> 00:42:20.539
Nope.

00:42:21.179 --> 00:42:22.719
Leave me alone.

00:42:29.419 --> 00:42:30.419
Collar.

00:42:31.019 --> 00:42:32.679
You must write your own destiny.

00:42:34.679 --> 00:42:36.399
Call out.

00:42:37.759 --> 00:42:39.739
You must write your own destiny.

00:42:41.679 --> 00:43:11.659
To be continued...

00:43:11.679 --> 00:43:41.659
To be continued...

